6. **CHECK `runs/` BEFORE WRITING ANY FILE IN A TASK DIRECTORY THAT ALREADY
   HOLDS A REPORT.** See `## THE RECORD I DAMAGED`. If the program can pass a
   retry the fact that it IS a retry, that would remove the failure mode
